From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:45:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): resolve unread imported comments by portable
 identity [daveey]

Address blocking review of PR #3133: retain source comment_id for existing consumers but stamp comment_uid from the sync-assigned row. Manual-release listings and seen watermarks resolve to receiver-local IDs. Legacy synced events conservatively list all same-time/author candidates, never trust colliding source integers. Missing data fails closed until sync repairs it; no seen override silently releases it. Direct automated DB paths remain unchanged.

Proof: imported-comment regression suite initially RED (14 failures) on prior head. GREEN: 312 tests across 14 files including all 29 requested regression guards, 31 original unread tests, 24 imported-comment cases, real apply_remote_changes owner-side release/collision/watermark and missing-data recovery. Existing fixtures required no seen override. Full checks rerun after fresh-main rebase. Card t_9ef4956ed2ea24fe.
